[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Inserire a fondo gli appositi attrezzi nelle relative sedi dell&#x27;autoradio.</p><p>2. Estrarre l&#x27;autoradio impugnando gli attrezzi.</p><p>3. Estrarre gli attrezzi dall&#x27;autoradio.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035463.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Scollegare le connessioni elettriche (1a, 1b, 1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Car radio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891020\">P20A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Car radio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891024\">P20B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Car radio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">P20C</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Scollegare la connessione dell&#x27;antenna autoradio.</p><p>3. Recuperare l&#x27;apparecchio autoradio.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035464.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Controllare che l&#x27;apparecchio\nautoradio non sia danneggiato.</p><p>Collegare le connessioni elettriche e la\nconnessione dell&#x27;antenna autoradio.</p><p>Inserire completamente in sede l&#x27;apparecchio\nautoradio.</p><p>Provare la funzionalità dell&#x27;apparecchio\nautoradio.</p>"]]